  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Program to Boost Investment in the Mining and Energy Sector for the Sustainable Growth of Bolivia</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Programa para Impulsar la Inversin en el Sector Minero-Energtico para el Crecimiento Sostenible de Bolivia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El objetivo general es contribuir a impulsar la inversin en el sector minero-energtico para el crecimiento sostenible de Bolivia. Los objetivos especficos son: (i) modernizar el marco legal y regulatorio del sector elctrico para promover la inversin privada y reducir la dependencia de los combustibles fsiles; y (ii) acelerar inversiones en el sector de minerales crticos fortaleciendo las condiciones para su desarrollo competitivo y sostenible.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The general objective is to help boost investment in the miningenergy sector for Bolivia&apos;s sustainable growth. The specific objectives are: (i) to modernize the legal and regulatory framework of the electricity sector to promote private investment and reduce dependence on fossil fuels; and (ii) to accelerate investments in the critical minerals sector by strengthening the conditions for its competitive and sustainable development.</narrative>
  </description>
